    "* **`.view()`** flattens the 3D data grid into a 2D matrix so the loss function can read it.\n",
    "* **`F.cross_entropy`** compares the model's raw votes against the actual correct target numbers.\n",
    "* **Loss** is the final penalty score used by PyTorch to tweak the table's numbers until it guesses right.\n"
